        self.assertIsNotNone(self.video)
        self.assertEqual(self.video.user, self.user)
```

### Prohibited Patterns

**Never do these in tests**:

- **Use production data**: Always use test fixtures/factories
- **Depend on test execution order**: Tests must be independent
- **Skip cleanup**: Always clean up test data
- **Mock everything**: Integration tests should use real services when possible
- **Hardcode values**: Use factories and fixtures for test data

### Test Checklist

For each feature:

- [ ] **Unit test**: Service layer test with mocked dependencies
- [ ] **Repository test**: Data access layer test
- [ ] **Integration test**: Service-to-service communication test
- [ ] **E2E test**: Complete user flow test
- [ ] **Error test**: Error scenario test
- [ ] **Performance test**: Query count and response time test

